### Test Get Lab Test Order by ID API
### This file tests the new endpoint: GET /api/v1/pharmacy/lab-test-orders/:orderId

### First, let's login to get a token (you'll need to replace with actual credentials)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Use the token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Test getting a lab test order by ID (replace with an actual orderId)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/lab-test-orders/ORD-123456789
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

