### Test with non-existent order ID (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/lab-test-orders/INVALID-ORDER-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Test without token (should return 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/lab-test-orders/ORD-123456789